---An incentive (bonus, commission, or other additional payment) for an employee. Incentives are paid out through payroll on the next applicable cycle after the effective date.
---@class remote.Incentive
---@field amount number The incentive amount in the employment's currency, in cents. For example, EUR 500.25 would be represented as 50025.
---@field amount_tax_type remote.AmountTaxType
---@field effective_date string|distilled.Null The date the incentive takes effect. Determines which payroll cycle the incentive will be paid in.
---@field employment_id string The unique identifier (UUID) of the employment this incentive belongs to.
---@field expected_payout_date? string|distilled.Null The expected date when this incentive will be paid to the employee. Null if not yet determined.
---@field id string The unique identifier (UUID) of the incentive.
---@field note? string|distilled.Null An optional note describing the reason or context for this incentive.
---@field payroll_output_category? string The broader payroll category this incentive's `type` belongs to (e.g., "incentive", "benefits_cash").
---@field period_end? string|distilled.Null The end date of the period this incentive covers. Null for non-periodic incentives.
---@field period_start? string|distilled.Null The start date of the period this incentive covers (e.g., for quarterly bonuses). Null for non-periodic incentives.
---@field recurring_incentive_id? string|distilled.Null If this incentive was generated from a recurring incentive schedule, this is the ID of the parent recurring incentive. Null for one-time incentives.
---@field status string The current status of the incentive (e.g., "pending", "scheduled", "paid", "cancelled").
---@field type string The type of incentive (e.g., "signing_bonus", "performance_bonus", "commission", "referral_bonus").
---@field type_label? string The human-readable label for `type` (e.g., "Signing bonus", "Commission", "Severance").

