---A job assigned to an employment, including its classification within the company's job architecture (family, sub-family, career track, level) and any custom field values.
---@class remote.Job
---@field career_track? remote.JobAssociation|distilled.Null
---@field code? string|distilled.Null An optional company-defined code for this job (e.g., "JOB-0"). Null if not set.
---@field custom_field_values? remote.JobCustomFieldValuesList
---@field description? string|distilled.Null A description of the job's responsibilities and scope. It may be plain text or HTML. HTML keeps only these tags: p, h1 to h6, strong, b, em, i, u, s, br, ul, ol, li, a, code, pre, blockquote, span and div, a text-align style on paragraphs and headings, and http, https and mailto links. Other tags are removed. Text over 10,000 bytes, and most text that looks like tags but has none of these, is returned HTML-escaped. Null if not set.
---@field id string The unique identifier (UUID) of the job.
---@field identifier string A company-defined identifier for this job (e.g., "eng-001").
---@field job_family? remote.JobAssociation|distilled.Null
---@field job_level? remote.JobAssociation|distilled.Null
---@field job_sub_family? remote.JobAssociation|distilled.Null
---@field label string The display name of the job (e.g., "Senior Backend Engineer").

