---Leave Policy Summary
---@class remote.LeavePolicySummary
---@field annual_balance remote.LeavePolicySummaryAnnualBalance The annual balance represents the balance for the current entitlement period. Unlike the regular balance, it does not account for accrued value and only considers the annual entitlement as the basis for calculations.
---@field annual_entitlement remote.LeavePolicySummaryAnnualEntitlement The annual entitlement represents what an employee is entitled to in the current entitlement period. It does not account for any accrued value.
---@field balance remote.LeavePolicySummaryBalance The balance is the entitlement minus the taken timeoff (i.e 10 entitlement - 3 taken = 7 balance)
---@field booked remote.LeavePolicySummaryBooked Includes all upcoming requested time off.
---@field current_entitlement remote.LeavePolicySummaryCurrentEntitlement The current entitlement is the accrued time entitled for the employee plus any other extra entitlements (such as carryover).
---@field leave_policy remote.EmployeeLeavePolicy
---@field pending_approval remote.LeavePolicySummaryPendingApproval Includes requested timeoffs (not approved) in the past or in the future.
---@field taken remote.LeavePolicySummaryTaken Includes all time off (past and future, pending or approved).
---@field upcoming_approved remote.LeavePolicySummaryUpcomingApproved Includes all upcoming approved time off.
---@field upcoming_requested remote.LeavePolicySummaryUpcomingRequested Includes all upcoming requested time off.
---@field used remote.LeavePolicySummaryUsed Includes only approved time off in the past.
---@field working_hours_per_day number

