---A lightweight representation of a payroll run used in list responses. Contains summary information and the total cost, but not the per-employee breakdown or cost category totals.
---@class remote.MinimalPayrollRun
---@field approval_date string|distilled.Null
---@field country remote.Country
---@field currency_code string
---@field cutoff_date? string|distilled.Null
---@field expected_payout_date string
---@field id string The unique identifier of the payroll run.
---@field period_end string
---@field period_start string
---@field status remote.MinimalPayrollRunStatus The current status of the payroll run. - `preparing`: The payroll run is being assembled. Costs are estimates. - `processing`: Submitted for processing. Costs are still estimates. - `completed`: Processing is complete. Costs are final. - `finalized`: Payments have been or will be disbursed. - `waiting_for_customer_approval`: Requires company approval before proceeding. - `rejected`: Rejected during approval and needs revision.
---@field total_payroll_cost number The total cost of this payroll run across all employees. Amount in cents.
---@field type remote.MinimalPayrollRunType The type of payroll run. - `main`: Regular recurring payroll. - `one_off`: Ad-hoc off-cycle payment. - `pro_forma`: Simulated run for cost estimation. - `tax_documents`: Tax document generation only. - `year_end_reports`: Year-end run holding employees' year-end tax documents. - `employer_year_end_reports`: Year-end run holding company-level reports for the employer to review and approve. Global Payroll only. - `expenses`: Dedicated expense reimbursement run. - `parallel`: Supplementary run alongside the main payroll.

---The current status of the payroll run.
---
---- `preparing`: The payroll run is being assembled. Costs are estimates.
---- `processing`: Submitted for processing. Costs are still estimates.
---- `completed`: Processing is complete. Costs are final.
---- `finalized`: Payments have been or will be disbursed.
---- `waiting_for_customer_approval`: Requires company approval before proceeding.
---- `rejected`: Rejected during approval and needs revision.
---@alias remote.MinimalPayrollRunStatus "preparing"|"processing"|"completed"|"finalized"|"waiting_for_customer_approval"|"rejected"

---The type of payroll run.
---
---- `main`: Regular recurring payroll.
---- `one_off`: Ad-hoc off-cycle payment.
---- `pro_forma`: Simulated run for cost estimation.
---- `tax_documents`: Tax document generation only.
---- `year_end_reports`: Year-end run holding employees' year-end tax documents.
---- `employer_year_end_reports`: Year-end run holding company-level reports for the employer to review and approve. Global Payroll only.
---- `expenses`: Dedicated expense reimbursement run.
---- `parallel`: Supplementary run alongside the main payroll.
---@alias remote.MinimalPayrollRunType "main"|"one_off"|"pro_forma"|"tax_documents"|"year_end_reports"|"employer_year_end_reports"|"expenses"|"parallel"

