---@class remote.TerminationDetailsParams
---@field acknowledge_termination_procedure? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the employer acknowledges and agrees to follow Remote's termination procedure for this jurisdiction.
---@field additional_comments? string|distilled.Null Additional details regarding the termination process.
---@field agrees_to_pto_amount? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the employer agrees with the employee's current paid time off balance. If false, you may provide a timesheet file documenting any discrepancies.
---@field agrees_to_pto_amount_notes? string|distilled.Null Additional notes about the PTO balance, especially if there are discrepancies.
---@field confidential boolean Confidential requests are visible for who authorized the token or integration. Non-confidential requests are visible to all admins in the company.
---@field customer_informed_employee? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the employer has already informed the employee about the termination. Remote advises not informing the employee until the request has been reviewed for legal risks.
---@field employee_awareness? remote.TerminationDetailsParamsEmployeeAwareness Remote advises not to inform the employee of their termination until we review your request for legal risks. When we approve your request, you can inform the employee and we’ll take it from there. This field is only required if employee was informed before creating the offboarding request.
---@field personal_email? string Remote will use this email address for post-termination communication. If it is not provided, this field will be derived from the employment record. Therefore, it is important to ensure that it is not a company email.
---@field proposed_termination_date string In most cases, employee needs to be notified before termination. The required notice period depends on local labor laws, the employment agreement, and other factors. Remote will use those factors to determine the required notice period. Please note that we cannot commit to a termination date until we conduct a full review of the information you submit.
---@field reason_description string Description of the reason for termination
---@field risk_assessment_reasons remote.TerminationDetailsParamsRiskAssessmentReasonsList Possible reasons for offboarding risk assessment
---@field termination_reason remote.TerminationDetailsParamsTerminationReason|string Choose an accurate termination reason to avoid unfair or unlawful dismissal claims. If the termination is created before the employee's start date, this field will be set to `cancellation_before_start_date`.
---@field termination_reason_files? remote.TerminationDetailsParamsTerminationReasonFilesList Any supporting documents regarding the termination reason
---@field timesheet_file? remote.OffboardingFile Paid time off accuracy Typically, any vacation pay accrued and unpaid at the time of termination must be paid out to the employee. To avoid overpaying or underpaying, please make sure we have an accurate account of their paid time off by querying the [Show Time Off Balance](#operation/get_show_timeoff_balance) endpoint, filtering by the `employment_id`. This optional document should be sent in case of any discrepancies.
---@field will_challenge_termination boolean Whether is it likely or not that the employee will challenge their termination
---@field will_challenge_termination_description? string If it is likely that the employee will challenge their termination, please provide additional details explaining the risk

---Remote advises not to inform the employee of their termination until we review your request for legal risks. When we approve your request, you can inform the employee and we’ll take it from there. This field is only required if employee was informed before creating the offboarding request.
---@class remote.TerminationDetailsParamsEmployeeAwareness
---@field date? string|distilled.Null When the employee was told about the termination.
---@field note? string|distilled.Null Notes describing how the termination was shared with the employee. Remote advises being as specific as possible, and include details about the employee’s response, if applicable.

---@alias remote.TerminationDetailsParamsRiskAssessmentReasonsItem "caring_responsibilities"|"disabled_or_health_condition"|"family_leave"|"member_of_union_or_works_council"|"none_of_these"|"pregnant_or_breastfeeding"|"reported_concerns_with_workplace"|"requested_medical_or_family_leave"|"sick_leave"

