---A work authorization request submitted by an employee who needs authorization to work in a different country. Similar to a travel letter request but specifically for work authorization purposes.
---@class remote.WorkAuthorizationRequest
---@field additional_information string Additional information provided by the employee about their work authorization needs.
---@field destination_country remote.Country
---@field employer_approver remote.WorkAuthorizationUser|distilled.Null
---@field employer_special_instructions string|distilled.Null Special instructions from the employer. Null if none provided.
---@field id string The unique identifier (UUID) of the work authorization request.
---@field reason string The reason for the work authorization request.
---@field status remote.WorkAuthorizationRequestStatus The current status of the work authorization request. - `pending`: Submitted and awaiting manager review. - `cancelled`: Cancelled by the employee. - `declined_by_manager`: Declined by the employer manager. - `declined_by_remote`: Declined by Remote after manager approval. - `approved_by_manager`: Approved by the manager, awaiting Remote's review. - `approved_by_remote`: Fully approved by both manager and Remote.
---@field submitted_at string
---@field travel_date_end string
---@field travel_date_start string
---@field travel_document_number string The employee's travel document (passport) number.
---@field user remote.WorkAuthorizationUser|distilled.Null
---@field will_negotiate_or_sign_contracts boolean|distilled.Null Whether the employee will negotiate or sign contracts on behalf of the company in the destination country. This may affect the type of work authorization required.
---@field work_location string|distilled.Null The specific work location or address in the destination country. Null if not specified.

---Schema for work authorization request
---@class remote.WorkAuthorizationRequestResponse
---@field data remote.WorkAuthorizationRequestResponseData

---@class remote.WorkAuthorizationRequestResponseData
---@field work_authorization_request remote.WorkAuthorizationRequest

---The current status of the work authorization request.
---
---- `pending`: Submitted and awaiting manager review.
---- `cancelled`: Cancelled by the employee.
---- `declined_by_manager`: Declined by the employer manager.
---- `declined_by_remote`: Declined by Remote after manager approval.
---- `approved_by_manager`: Approved by the manager, awaiting Remote's review.
---- `approved_by_remote`: Fully approved by both manager and Remote.
---@alias remote.WorkAuthorizationRequestStatus "pending"|"cancelled"|"declined_by_manager"|"declined_by_remote"|"approved_by_manager"|"approved_by_remote"

---A user associated with a work authorization request (either the employee or the employer approver).
---@class remote.WorkAuthorizationUser
---@field email string The user's email address.
---@field id string The unique identifier (UUID) of the user.
---@field name string The user's full name.

