---Download a payslip file
---
---Given a Payslip ID, downloads the payslip file as raw bytes. Payslips are usually PDFs; the
---`Content-Type` header gives the file's type.
---The user the token acts for must have one role that can view payroll, open files and open payslip files,
---even when your integration doesn't enforce role permissions; otherwise the request answers 403. A payslip of an
---employee outside the data scope of every role that holds those permissions answers 404.
---It is important to note that each country has a different payslip format and they are not authored by Remote.
---
---## Authentication
---
---This endpoint accepts any one of the following token types:
---
---- **Company-scoped access token** (`OAuth2AuthorizationCode`) — obtained by a company manager through the Authorization Code flow or the Refresh Token flow. See [Authentication for partners](https://developer.remote.com/docs/authentication-for-partners).
