---Download a payslip as a base64 data URI
---
---Given a Payslip ID, downloads a payslip.
---It is important to note that each country has a different payslip format and they are not authored by Remote.
---
---The response body is text, not the file's bytes: a data URI such as `data:application/pdf;base64,`
---followed by the base64-encoded file. Strip the prefix and decode the rest to get the file.
---To get the file's bytes directly, use `GET /v1/payslips/{payslip_id}/download`.
---
